NOTICE
======

This repository contains the ARIS.jl package together with the code,
configurations, and result artifacts used to reproduce the reported tables,
figures, and diagnostics.


1. ConditionalGenerativeValidation.jl
-------------------------------------

The core library in `src/` and the problem definitions in
`examples/problems/` derive from ConditionalGenerativeValidation.jl by
Harrison Delecki:

https://github.com/hdelecki/ConditionalGenerativeValidation.jl

That project provides the conditional generative validation framework on which
this work builds. This repository retains its package UUID
`0b8de057-cb0d-4b1a-91d7-07cc9cdc0c12` under the module name `ARIS`.

The original project is MIT licensed, Copyright (c) 2025 hdelecki
<hdelecki@stanford.edu> and contributors. Its license is reproduced in the
root `LICENSE` file and governs the derived material.


